0%2C0%2C900%2C675&amp;q=95&amp;fm=webp&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/c211ecc2-2296-4304-b1a4-fe632300ef04_shannon%20hall%20and%20kid%20headbands.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=cover&amp;rect=150%2C0%2C900%2C675&amp;q=95&amp;fm=webp&amp;width=1200 1200w, https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/c211ecc2-2296-4304-b1a4-fe632300ef04_shannon%20hall%20and%20kid%20headbands.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=cover&amp;rect=150%2C0%2C900%2C675&amp;q=95&amp;fm=webp&amp;width=2048 2048w, https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/c211ecc2-2296-4304-b1a4-fe632300ef04_shannon%20hall%20and%20kid%20headbands.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=cover&amp;rect=150%2C0%2C900%2C675&amp;q=95&amp;fm=webp&amp;width=3840 3840w" alt="Mother and daughter touch foreheads, each wearing patterned headbands. The mother has tattoos on her arm and shoulder." loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="HomePageHerostyles__MobileHeaderOverlay-sc-irizko-9 zREcC"><h1 class="Utilitystyles__HeroH1-sc-d2senx-3 HomePageHerostyles__MobileHeader-sc-irizko-10 csCciE jSoBmB">10+ years of personalized support.</h1></div></div><div class="HomePageHerostyles__BluePanel-sc-irizko-1 iSqgiO"></div><h1 class="Utilitystyles__HeroH1-sc-d2senx-3 HomePageHerostyles__Header-sc-irizko-2 csCciE dNJsxA">10+ years of personalized support.</h1><div class="HomePageHerostyles__LightCard-sc-irizko-3 kyzriT"><div class="HomePageHerostyles__LightCardInner-sc-irizko-4 btAhek"><p>NPF’s Patient Navigation Center has helped nearly 100,000 people across the U.S. and 167 other countries with their psoriatic disease journey.</p><div class="HomePageHerostyles__CtaContainer-sc-irizko-5 kBQMfj"><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 eKczsF" href="/navigationcenter/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Get connected</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="HomePageHerostyles__CtaRow-sc-irizko-8 fVoUUg"><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 eKczsF" href="/resource-library/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Resources</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 eKczsF" href="/advance/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Stories</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 eKczsF" href="/donate/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Support the Mission</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a></div></div><div class="MissionStatementstyles__MissionStatementContainer-sc-1iia4pv-0 leQIrl"><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 MissionStatementstyles__MissionStatementBodyCopy-sc-1iia4pv-1 kMQgqG gssRyq"><h3>The mission of the National Psoriasis Foundation is to drive efforts to cure psoriatic disease and improve the lives of those affected.</h3><p>Over 8 million people in the U.S. have psoriasis. Nearly a third of them will develop psoriatic arthritis. A world without psoriatic disease and the related burdens is possible. We won&#x27;t stop until you have the cure you deserve. </p></div></div><div class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Container-sc-120pdf8-0 kkHyhG"><div class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Heading-sc-120pdf8-1 dAXGRF"><h2>Your experience with psoriatic disease is unique.</h2></div><div class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Copy-sc-120pdf8-2 dVGFou"><p>Which best describes you?</p></div><div class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkContainer-sc-120pdf8-3 ilhMBh"><div class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkEyebrow-sc-120pdf8-4 kVgXsR">Select One:</div><ul class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkList-sc-120pdf8-5 kBATRK"><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/i-am-not-sure-if-i-have-psoriasis/">I am not sure if I have psoriasis.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/i-am-newly-diagnosed/">I am newly diagnosed.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/i-am-living-with-psoriasis/">I am living with psoriasis.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/i-am-living-with-psoriatic-arthritis/">I am living with psoriatic arthritis.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/my-current-treatment-is-not-working/">My treatment isn’t working.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/i-am-supporting-someone-with-psoriatic-disease/">I am supporting someone.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/for-medical-professionals/">I am a health care provider.</a></li><li class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__LinkListItem-sc-120pdf8-6 ihPSvh"><a class="LinkListWithHeadingstyles__Link-sc-120pdf8-7 hBTpVY" href="/about-research/">I am interested in research.</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 BodyContentBlockstyles__ContentGrid-sc-1tjnlqe-0 fvbrzl cbSDMK EccWY"><article class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyContentBlock-sc-1tjnlqe-1 kHEGjL"><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 kMQgqG"><h2 id="whats-new-at-npf">What&#x27;s New at NPF</h2></div></article></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 ImageBlockWithTextstyles__ImageBlockWithText-sc-129eum3-0 fvbrzl gEFnwX daHcTA"><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__ImageBlockIrregularGrid-sc-129eum3-1 eoroPz"><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__TextContainer-sc-129eum3-2 kiuYOc"><h2 class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__Title-sc-129eum3-3 eTuuN">Progress Toward a PsA Diagnostic Test</h2><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__BodyText-sc-129eum3-4 qGDqn"><p>Because of your sustained support, NPF funded investigators have advanced the understanding of the development of PsA and taken significant steps toward quicker and more accurate diagnosis. </p><p>“This research lays the groundwork for prevention-focused strategies and more durable disease control, improving quality of life and long-term outcomes for people living with psoriatic disease,” Dr. Scher says. “NPF funding is what makes this progress possible.”</p></div><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 cDaAjK" href="/advance/psoriatic-arthritis-diagnostic-test-grant/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Read about the research outcomes</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a></div><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__CircleAccent-sc-129eum3-8 eyhziE"><svg viewBox="0 0 106 106" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="53" cy="53" r="50" stroke="#829FE8" stroke-width="6"></circle></svg></div><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__ImageContainer-sc-129eum3-6 dMnSRg"><picture class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__Image-sc-129eum3-7 cqBKoo"><source media="(max-width: 499px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aZZVocFoBIGEgijK_iStock-1493586956.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=398%2C0%2C1325%2C1414&amp;w=370&amp;h=395"/><source media="(min-width: 500px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aZZVocFoBIGEgijK_iStock-1493586956.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=39%2C0%2C2042%2C1414&amp;w=650&amp;h=450"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aZZVocFoBIGEgijK_iStock-1493586956.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=39%2C0%2C2042%2C1414&amp;w=650&amp;h=450" alt="A scientific assay conducted in a research lab."/></picture></div></div></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 GridBlockstyles__GridBlock-sc-1qhx8gz-0 fvbrzl gEFnwX kETLVJ"><div data-columns="--3-column" class="GridBlockstyles__Grid-sc-1qhx8gz-1 eoZIxb"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItem-sc-1qhx8gz-2 eoEWVH"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemContainer-sc-1qhx8gz-9 jeDPmk"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemColumn-sc-1qhx8gz-4 ftZWyF"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemImageLink-sc-1qhx8gz-10 dJyXNd"><picture class="GridBlockstyles__Picture-sc-1qhx8gz-5 guletw"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aHV7EkMqNJQqH5gv_2-3-up-778x447px--12-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=43%2C0%2C693%2C447&amp;w=310&amp;h=200"/><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aHV7EkMqNJQqH5gv_2-3-up-778x447px--12-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C778%2C447&amp;w=778&amp;h=447"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aHV7EkMqNJQqH5gv_2-3-up-778x447px--12-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C778%2C447&amp;w=778&amp;h=447" alt="Psoriasis Uncovered"/></picture></div><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemTitleLink-sc-1qhx8gz-11 bETfnL"><h2>Psoriasis Uncovered</h2></div><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 GridBlockstyles__Summary-sc-1qhx8gz-3 kMQgqG cqgxqk"><p>The Psoriasis Uncovered podcast delves into the complexities of psoriasis, psoriatic arthritis, and related conditions.</p><p>We want to hear from you! <a href="https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.surveymonkey.com%2Fr%2FV8TXBMN&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cdberry%40psoriasis.org%7C493cc2e323ce43201f6908de7585453b%7C2aebf1c6a0cd43538d20f9293b9ab46e%7C0%7C0%7C639077412445685478%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=kXOU63j78IU0X918ty6DxRjm9o1vUsuSBsiImiSQ2x0%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><strong>Take our five-minute podcast survey.</strong></a></p></div><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemCtaWrapper-sc-1qhx8gz-12 dLTiYl"><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 eKczsF" href="/watch-and-listen/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Listen to the latest episode</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItem-sc-1qhx8gz-2 eoEWVH"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemLink-sc-1qhx8gz-8 ZavAC"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemColumn-sc-1qhx8gz-4 ftZWyF"><picture class="GridBlockstyles__Picture-sc-1qhx8gz-5 guletw"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/144bf186-7038-4886-9d05-e3aaa258c899_psoriasis%20shampoo%20wide.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=77%2C0%2C1046%2C675&amp;w=310&amp;h=200"/><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/144bf186-7038-4886-9d05-e3aaa258c899_psoriasis%20shampoo%20wide.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=13%2C0%2C1175%2C675&amp;w=778&amp;h=447"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/144bf186-7038-4886-9d05-e3aaa258c899_psoriasis%20shampoo%20wide.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=13%2C0%2C1175%2C675&amp;w=778&amp;h=447"/></picture><h2>4 Psoriasis Shampoos Your Scalp Will Love</h2><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 GridBlockstyles__Summary-sc-1qhx8gz-3 kMQgqG cqgxqk"><p>Looking for a medicated hair product that keeps the itching and flaking at bay? Discover which shampoos have been recognized by NPF.</p></div><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCta-sc-1qhx8gz-6 bdvLkP bhzdPp"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCtaText-sc-1qhx8gz-7 hyriAe">Read more</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItem-sc-1qhx8gz-2 eoEWVH"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemLink-sc-1qhx8gz-8 ZavAC"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemColumn-sc-1qhx8gz-4 ftZWyF"><picture class="GridBlockstyles__Picture-sc-1qhx8gz-5 guletw"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aX0CAgIvOtkhCIee_iStock-2223492515.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=865%2C0%2C3077%2C1985&amp;w=310&amp;h=200"/><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aX0CAgIvOtkhCIee_iStock-2223492515.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=676%2C0%2C3455%2C1985&amp;w=778&amp;h=447"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aX0CAgIvOtkhCIee_iStock-2223492515.jpg?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=676%2C0%2C3455%2C1985&amp;w=778&amp;h=447" alt="Essential oils"/></picture><h2>Essential Oils for Psoriasis</h2><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 GridBlockstyles__Summary-sc-1qhx8gz-3 kMQgqG cqgxqk"><p>Curious about essential oils for psoriasis? Some oils contain compounds that may help reduce inflammation, ease discomfort, or promote relaxation. Learn what they can (and can’t) do, and how to use them safely.</p></div><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCta-sc-1qhx8gz-6 bdvLkP bhzdPp"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCtaText-sc-1qhx8gz-7 hyriAe">Read more</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 ImageBlockWithTextstyles__ImageBlockWithText-sc-129eum3-0 fvbrzl gEFnwX daHcTA"><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__ImageBlockIrregularGrid-sc-129eum3-1 jxkjyD"><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__TextContainer-sc-129eum3-2 hecfAK"><h2 class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__Title-sc-129eum3-3 dxHyIB">Psoriasis Simplified</h2><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__BodyText-sc-129eum3-4 kVwkmz"><p>Your journey with psoriatic disease is unique, but it doesn’t have to be confusing. Explore the NPF Care Path and take the first step toward getting care and living your healthiest life.</p></div><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 dwWfPO" href="/care-path/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">Take the next step</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a></div><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__CircleAccent-sc-129eum3-8 eWzeav"><svg viewBox="0 0 106 106" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="53" cy="53" r="50" stroke="#829FE8" stroke-width="6"></circle></svg></div><div class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__ImageContainer-sc-129eum3-6 hHMTqH"><picture class="ImageBlockWithTextstyles__Image-sc-129eum3-7 cqBKoo"><source media="(max-width: 499px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/ZyF4sK8jQArT0AYo_Imagewithtextmobile-370%C3%97395px--1-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C370%2C395&amp;w=370&amp;h=395"/><source media="(min-width: 500px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/ZyF4r68jQArT0AYn_CarePath.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C650%2C450&amp;w=650&amp;h=450"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/ZyF4r68jQArT0AYn_CarePath.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C650%2C450&amp;w=650&amp;h=450" alt="Explore Your Care Path"/></picture></div></div></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 BodyContentBlockstyles__ContentGrid-sc-1tjnlqe-0 fvbrzl cbSDMK EccWY"><article class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyContentBlock-sc-1tjnlqe-1 kHEGjL"><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 kMQgqG"><h2 id="information-to-stay-healthy">Information to Stay Healthy</h2></div></article></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 GridBlockstyles__GridBlock-sc-1qhx8gz-0 fvbrzl gEFnwX kETLVJ"><div data-columns="--3-column" class="GridBlockstyles__Grid-sc-1qhx8gz-1 eoZIxb"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItem-sc-1qhx8gz-2 eoEWVH"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemLink-sc-1qhx8gz-8 ZavAC"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemColumn-sc-1qhx8gz-4 ftZWyF"><picture class="GridBlockstyles__Picture-sc-1qhx8gz-5 guletw"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/2143046e-5739-435f-a5a8-4fc4f907763a_Homepage%20Hero%20Image%20(3).png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C71%2C460%2C297&amp;w=310&amp;h=200"/><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/2143046e-5739-435f-a5a8-4fc4f907763a_Homepage%20Hero%20Image%20(3).png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C97%2C460%2C264&amp;w=778&amp;h=447"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/2143046e-5739-435f-a5a8-4fc4f907763a_Homepage%20Hero%20Image%20(3).png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C97%2C460%2C264&amp;w=778&amp;h=447" alt="Lisa lives with psoriatic disease."/></picture><h2>Articles and Updates</h2><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 GridBlockstyles__Summary-sc-1qhx8gz-3 kMQgqG cqgxqk"><p>The latest stories and information curated for you.</p></div><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCta-sc-1qhx8gz-6 bdvLkP bhzdPp"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCtaText-sc-1qhx8gz-7 hyriAe">Read</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItem-sc-1qhx8gz-2 eoEWVH"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemLink-sc-1qhx8gz-8 ZavAC"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemColumn-sc-1qhx8gz-4 ftZWyF"><picture class="GridBlockstyles__Picture-sc-1qhx8gz-5 guletw"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aVwCyHNYClf9ozAG_AdvanceForm-536x302px-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1091%2C704&amp;w=310&amp;h=200"/><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aVwCyHNYClf9ozAG_AdvanceForm-536x302px-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1225%2C704&amp;w=778&amp;h=447"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aVwCyHNYClf9ozAG_AdvanceForm-536x302px-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1225%2C704&amp;w=778&amp;h=447" alt="Aimee and Brenda live with psoriatic disease"/></picture><h2>Tips and Tools</h2><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 GridBlockstyles__Summary-sc-1qhx8gz-3 kMQgqG cqgxqk"><p>Weekly updates on living your best life with psoriatic disease.</p></div><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCta-sc-1qhx8gz-6 bdvLkP bhzdPp"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCtaText-sc-1qhx8gz-7 hyriAe">Subscribe</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItem-sc-1qhx8gz-2 eoEWVH"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemLink-sc-1qhx8gz-8 ZavAC"><div class="GridBlockstyles__GridItemColumn-sc-1qhx8gz-4 ftZWyF"><picture class="GridBlockstyles__Picture-sc-1qhx8gz-5 guletw"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aYvP-90YXLCxVqz6_2-3-up-778x447px--45-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;rect=43%2C0%2C693%2C447&amp;w=310&amp;h=200"/><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aYvP-90YXLCxVqz6_2-3-up-778x447px--45-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/npf-website/aYvP-90YXLCxVqz6_2-3-up-778x447px--45-.png?ixlib=gatsbyFP&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" alt="NPF Seal of Recognition"/></picture><h2>Seal of Recognition</h2><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 GridBlockstyles__Summary-sc-1qhx8gz-3 kMQgqG cqgxqk"><p>These products have been created or are intended to be non-irritating and safe for people with psoriatic disease.</p></div><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCta-sc-1qhx8gz-6 bdvLkP bhzdPp"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 GridBlockstyles__GridItemCtaText-sc-1qhx8gz-7 hyriAe">View the product directory</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 BodyContentBlockstyles__ContentGrid-sc-1tjnlqe-0 fvbrzl kKkyjj EccWY"><article class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyContentBlock-sc-1tjnlqe-1 kHEGjL"><div class="BodyContentBlockstyles__BodyCopy-sc-1tjnlqe-2 kMQgqG"><h2 id="join-us-wherever-you-are">Join Us, Wherever You Are</h2></div></article></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarOfEventsBlock-sc-11li8gd-0 fvbrzl kKkyjj gUUmAm"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarGrid-sc-11li8gd-1 jhwIRV"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CircleAccent-sc-11li8gd-2 gKaRbc"></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__SectionHeader-sc-11li8gd-3 hsKQyl">Upcoming Events</div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEvent-sc-11li8gd-4 FzxT"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventLink-sc-11li8gd-7 cnnyma"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__EventInfoRow-sc-11li8gd-9 hqDfhK"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__DateBox-sc-11li8gd-10 ebHdOW"><span>Sat</span><span>04/25</span></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__TimeAndLocationBox-sc-11li8gd-12 jnaUGf"><span>6:00<!-- --> – <!-- -->10:00 p.m. CT</span><span>Dallas, TX</span></div></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__EventDetailColumn-sc-11li8gd-13 daWjdO"><h2>Dallas Soirée </h2><p>Join us for the Dallas Soirée: Celebrating Women Who Lead, an inspiring evening supporting the National Psoriasis Foundation&#x27;s mission of curing psoriatic disease and improving the lives of those affected. Honoring Dr. Jennifer Cather and Melodie Young.</p><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventCta-sc-11li8gd-5 eKczsF glUZgS"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventCtaText-sc-11li8gd-6 hyriAe">Learn More About This Event</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEvent-sc-11li8gd-4 FzxT"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventLink-sc-11li8gd-7 cnnyma"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__EventInfoRow-sc-11li8gd-9 hqDfhK"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__DateBox-sc-11li8gd-10 ebHdOW"><span>Thu</span><span>05/07</span></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__TimeAndLocationBox-sc-11li8gd-12 jnaUGf"><span>6:00<!-- --> – <!-- -->10:00 p.m. ET</span><span>Atlanta, GA</span></div></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__EventDetailColumn-sc-11li8gd-13 daWjdO"><h2>Southeast Soirée: An Evening of Jazz &amp; Generosity</h2><p>Join the National Psoriasis Foundation for the 4th annual Southeast Soirée: An Evening of Jazz &amp; Generosity! An inspiring evening to raise awareness and critical funds to advance NPF&#x27;s mission of curing psoriatic disease and improving the lives of those affected. Honoring T.J. Chao, PA-C, Dr. Julio A. Gonzalez-Paoli, Dr. Patricia Oyetakin, and Wendy Simmons, PA-C.</p><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventCta-sc-11li8gd-5 eKczsF glUZgS"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventCtaText-sc-11li8gd-6 hyriAe">Learn More About This Event</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEvent-sc-11li8gd-4 FzxT"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventLink-sc-11li8gd-7 cnnyma"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__EventInfoRow-sc-11li8gd-9 hqDfhK"><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__DateBox-sc-11li8gd-10 ebHdOW"><span>Sat</span><span>05/30</span></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__TimeAndLocationBox-sc-11li8gd-12 jnaUGf"><span>6:00<!-- --> – <!-- -->10:00 p.m. PT</span><span>San Francisco</span></div></div><div class="CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__EventDetailColumn-sc-11li8gd-13 daWjdO"><h2>San Francisco Soirée</h2><p>Step into the glitz and glamour of the Golden Age of Jazz. The National Psoriasis Foundation is proud to recognize three extraordinary leaders and champions of our mission at this inaugural event! Join us in honoring Dr. Lianne Gensler, Melissa Leeolou, and Dr. Wilson Liao.</p><div class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventCta-sc-11li8gd-5 eKczsF glUZgS"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 CalendarOfEventsBlockstyles__CalendarEventCtaText-sc-11li8gd-6 hyriAe">Learn More About This Event</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 CtaBlockstyles__CtaBlock-sc-8tjw7w-0 CtaBlockstyles__LeftAlignedCtaBlock-sc-8tjw7w-1 fvbrzl gEFnwX hgHRkO imGLXP"><div class="CtaBlockstyles__LeftAlignedTextContainer-sc-8tjw7w-3 iKdVki"><div class="CtaBlockstyles__Body-sc-8tjw7w-5 kFzZjQ"><p>NPF hosts in-person and virtual events to connect the community, spread awareness, and raise funds for a cure.</p></div><a class="CtaLinkstyles__CtaContainer-sc-1vnawpd-1 cveWed" href="/events/"><span class="CtaLinkstyles__TextLink-sc-1vnawpd-0 hyriAe">View all NPF events</span><svg width="18" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18 0)"><path d="M8.11861 15.3633C8.5169 15.7245 9.12431 15.7245 9.5226 15.3633C9.97956 14.9488 9.97988 14.2308 9.52329 13.8159L4.22291 9L16.6411 9C17.1934 9 17.6411 8.55228 17.6411 8C17.6411 7.44771 17.1934 7 16.6411 7L4.22291 7L9.52329 2.18406C9.97989 1.7692 9.97957 1.05115 9.5226 0.636695C9.12431 0.275455 8.5169 0.275455 8.11861 0.636695L0.816781 7.25928C0.379201 7.65616 0.379203 8.34384 0.816783 8.74072L8.11861 15.3633Z"></path></g></svg></a></div></div></main><footer style="margin-top:37px"><div class="Footerstyles__FooterUpperRegion-sc-ax4qti-0 eErTmh"><div class="Utilitystyles__RegionContainer-sc-d2senx-0 Utilitystyles__GriddedContentBlock-sc-d2senx-1 Footerstyles__FooterContentRegionGrid-sc-ax4qti-2 fvbrzl gEFnwX lcXrmG"><div class="Footerstyles__NavColumn-sc-ax4qti-7 AinMQ"><a aria-current="page" class="" href="/"><svg width="215" height="87" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M41.4882 77.0013C39.1207 70.1242 24.2391 63.1343 26.3811 51.2966C12.1759 57.2718 0 41.8265 0 41.8265C0.11274 41.7137 0.338219 41.601 0.450959 41.7137C0.563699 41.8265 9.01918 49.38 18.1511 47.8017C27.283 46.3361 34.7239 38.557 39.1207 39.1207C39.3462 39.1207 39.4589 39.3462 39.4589 39.4589C39.4589 39.6844 39.3462 39.6844 39.1207 39.7971C36.0767 41.0373 30.5525 47.5762 32.1308 56.7081C33.371 63.9235 40.3608 67.8694 41.8265 76.3249C41.7137 76.7758 41.601 76.8885 41.4882 77.0013C41.4882 77.0013 41.601 77.0013 41.4882 77.0013Z" fill="#ffffff"></path><path d="M16.2344 61.5559C17.2491